    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MS Excel 365 Node\n\n**WHAT IT DOES:**\n* Connects to MS Excel 365 to read, write, and update data\n* Supports operations: append rows, update rows, get rows, clear sheets\n* Can work with multiple sheets in a spreadsheet\n\n**HOW TO USE:**\n2. Select the spreadsheet by ID or from list\n3. Choose operation (append, update, read)\n4. Map columns to your workflow data\n\n**USE CASES:**\n* Recording transaction logs\n  * Columns: `transaction_id`, `customer_id`, `...`\n* Importing customer data for processing\n  * Columns: `customer_id`, `first_name`, `...`\n\n**REFERENCES:**\nhttps://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/app-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.microsoftexcel/",
        "height": 556,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
